  "folder": "slrw8J4BHT24qLkW",
  "name": "析米克混生体 Simic Hybrid (GGR)",
  "type": "race",
  "_id": "cKzMYB4To44y7b0b",
  "img": "icons/creatures/magical/humanoid-silhouette-aliens-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">属性值</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">体型</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">体质</span> +2; <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">任选一项其他属性</span> +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">中型体型</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">30尺</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">年龄Age。</strong>混生体获得生命时已经是成年人类、精灵或者维多肯了。它们显示出轻微加速老化的迹象，因此它们的最大寿命可能会有所减少，但守护者计划还没有运行足够长的时间来观察这种现象所反映的全部影响。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">阵营Alignment。</strong>总体上大多数混生体都具有析米克联合的中立特性。他们更感兴趣的是科学研究和协会的地位，而不是道德或伦理问题。然而，那些离开联合的人经常讨论道德或伦理问题，因为他们的哲学观点和阵营更符合一个不同的公会。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">体型Size。</strong>你属于中型体型，在你的基础类人种族范围内。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度Speed。</strong>你的基础步行速度为30尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">黑暗视觉Darkvision。</strong>在微光光照下，你身边60尺内可以视为等同于明亮光照。而在黑暗中，该范围内可视为等同于微光光照。你无法在黑暗中分辨颜色，只能看到有灰度的黑白画面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">语言 Language。：</strong>你可以说、读与写通用语，另外你在维多肯语（需要手动添加）和精灵语中选择一个获得说、读与写能力<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">动物强化。</strong>你的身体已经被改变以融入某些动物特征。你现在选择一个动物强化，然后在第5级选择第二个强化。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">在第一级，选择以下选项之一:</span></p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Manta Glide\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">蝠鲼滑翔 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Manta Glide.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你的蝠翼可以减缓你的下降，让你滑翔。当你坠落而没有失能，在计算坠落伤害时，你可以从坠落高度中减去100英尺，每下降1英尺，你可以水平移动2英尺。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Climber\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">灵活攀登 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Nimble Climber.</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你获得等于你步行速度的攀爬速度。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Underwater Adaptation\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">水下适应 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Underwater Adaptation.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你可以在水中呼吸空气，你获得等于你步行速度的游泳速度。</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">在第5级时，选择以下选项之一，或者选择你在第1级时没有选择的选项之一:</span></p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Grappling Appendage\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">斗殴附件 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Grappling Appendage.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你的手臂旁边长着两个特殊的附肢。你可以选择它们是爪子还是触手。使用一个动作，你可以使用他们来尝试擒抱一个生物。这些附肢都是天生武器，你可以用它们进行徒手攻击。如果你用它攻击，目标会受到1d6 +你的力量调整值的钝击伤害，而非普通徒手攻击的钝击伤害。在击中目标后，你可以尝试用附赠动作擒拿抱目标。这些附肢不能精确操控任何东西，也不能使用武器、魔法物品或其他特殊装备。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Carapace\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">甲壳 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Carapace.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你皮肤的一些地方被厚厚的外壳 覆盖着。当你不穿重甲时，你将获得AC +1加值。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Acid Spit\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">酸液喷吐 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Acid Spit.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">使用动作你可以从口腔的腺体中喷射出一股酸性物质，选择30英尺内你能看到的一个生物或物体作为目标。除非其成功通过DC等于8 +你的体质调整值+你的熟练加值的敏捷豁免检定，否则目标受到2d10强酸伤害。当你达到第11级(3d10)和第17级(4d10)时，伤害增加1d10。该特性的可用次数等于你的体质调整值（至少一次）。通过完成一次长休你可以恢复全部已消耗次数。</span></p></li></ul></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">析米克联合使用魔法将不同的生命形式融合在一起。近年来，他们将这项研究扩展到类人生物上，用魔法将各种动物的特质转化至人类、精灵和维多肯身上。他们将此行为称之为守护者计划。其目标是建立由超能士兵组成的析米克军队，以求完美地适应各种战斗情况。这些超进化的试验品被称为析米克混生体，然而有时他们也自称守护者。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">广泛的适应<br></strong>尽管大多数混生体保持其基本的身体形态，但混生体的生物性增强可以显着地改变其外观。所有的杂拼兽都拥一些动物的物理特性，这些动物主要是水生和爬行或两栖动物的生物。包括蟹爪，鱿鱼触角，蝠鲼的翅膀或鳍，半透明或伪装的皮肤，或者充满尖锐牙齿的似鲨鱼状颚。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">混生体是析米克魔法的产物。对于混生体来说，离开析米克联合并加入另一个公会并非不可能，但析米克会认为这个混生体是逃兵，而且新公会可能永远不会完全欢迎一个能轻易成为析米克间谍的混生体。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">混生体姓名</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">混生体通常带有人类、精灵或 维多肯父母给出的名字。但是有些混生体在他们的改造之后, 由他们自己或者其转化者选择一个新的名字。</span></p></div></div></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Constitution +2; Choose any other +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Age.</span> Hybrids begin their lives as adult humans, elves, or vedalken. They age at a slightly accelerated rate, so their maximum life spans are probably reduced somewhat. The Guardian Project has not been operating long enough to observe the full effect of this phenomenon.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Alignment\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Alignment.</span> Most hybrids share the generally neutral outlook of the Simic Combine. They are more interested in scientific research and the standing of their guild than in moral or ethical questions. Those who leave the Combine, however, often do so because their philosophical outlook and alignment are more in line with a different guild's.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> Your size is Medium, within the normal range of your humanoid base race.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You can't discern color in darkness, only shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and your choice of Elvish or Vedalken.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Animal Enhancement\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Animal Enhancement.</span> Your body has been altered to incorporate certain animal characteristics. You choose one animal enhancement now and a second enhancement at 5th level.</p><p>At 1st level, choose one of the following options:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Manta Glide\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Manta Glide.</span> You have ray-like fins that you can use as wings to slow your fall or allow you to glide. When you fall and aren't &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated], you can subtract up to 100 feet from the fall when calculating falling damage, and you can move up to 2 feet horizontally for every 1 foot you descend.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Climber\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Nimble Climber.</span> You have a climbing speed equal to your walking speed.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Underwater Adaptation\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Underwater Adaptation.</span> You can breathe air and water, and you have a swimming speed equal to your walking speed.</p></li></ul><p>At 5th level, your body evolves further, developing new characteristics. Choose one of the options you didn't take at 1st level, or one of the following options:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Grappling Appendage\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Grappling Appendage.</span> You have two special appendages growing alongside your arms. Choose whether they're both claws or tentacles. As an action, you can use one of them to try to grapple a creature. Each one is also a natural weapon, which you can use to make an unarmed strike. If you hit with it, the target takes bludgeoning damage equal to [[/damage 1d6]] + your Strength modifier, instead of the bludgeoning damage normal for an unarmed strike. Immediately after hitting, you can try to grapple the target as a bonus action. These appendages can't precisely manipulate anything and can't wield weapons, magic items, or other specialized equipment.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Carapace\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Carapace.</span> Your skin in places is covered by a thick shell. You gain a +1 bonus to AC when you're not wearing heavy armor.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Acid Spit\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Acid Spit.</span> As an action, you can spray acid from glands in your mouth, targeting one creature or object you can see within 30 feet of you. The target takes [[/damage 2d10 type=acid]] damage unless it succeeds on a Dexterity saving throw against a DC equal to 8 + your Constitution modifier + your proficiency bonus. This damage increases by [[/damage 1d10]] when you reach 11th level ([[/damage 3d10]]) and 17th level ([[/damage 4d10]]). You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Constitution modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses of it when you finish a long rest.</p></li></ul></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>The Simic Combine uses magic to fuse different life forms together. In recent years, the Simic Combine has extended this research to humanoid subjects, magically transferring the traits of various animals into humans, elves, and vedalken. The goal of the Guardian Project is to build a Simic army of soldiers perfectly adapted to a variety of combat situations. These hyper-evolved specimens are called Simic hybrids, though they sometimes refer to themselves as guardians.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Extensive Adaptation\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Extensive Adaptation.</span> A hybrid's biological enhancements can change its appearance drastically, though most hybrids retain their basic physical form. All are augmented with characteristics of animals, mostly aquatic, reptilian, or amphibian creatures. These include crab claws, squid tentacles, wings or fins like those of manta rays, translucent or camouflaged skin, or shark-like maws filled with sharp teeth.</p><p>Hybrids are the product of Simic magic. It's not impossible for a hybrid to leave the Simic Combine and join another guild, but the Simic would consider the individual a deserter. And the new guild might never fully welcome a hybrid who could easily be a Simic spy.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Simic Hybrid Names\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Simic Hybrid Names.</span> A hybrid usually bears the name given by their human, elf, or vedalken parents. Some hybrids assume a new name after their transformation—a name chosen personally or by those who transformed them.</p></div></div></div></div>",
